OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after car hits war memorial
OL,4,Awall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 34-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a car hit a war memorial.
OL,9,FSussex Police said officers were called
OL,10,Fto reports of a single vehicle crash
OL,11,Foutside the All Saints Church in
OL,12,FCrowborough at 23:30 on Friday.
OL,14,FThe force added that a vehicle was
OL,15,Ffound with "serious damage" after
OL,16,Fhitting the wall around the memorial.
OL,18,FOfficers said the driver, who is from
OL,19,Fthe East Sussex town, was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of drug driving.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
